{"fps": 30, "total": 188.42, "hash": "f62521ddbdc28204", "chapters": [], "beats": [{"id": "k1", "text": "Banks made six billion dollars in one year from people with no money.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.129, "words": [{"text": "Banks", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.318}, {"text": "made", "start": 0.344, "end": 0.542}, {"text": "six", "start": 0.564, "end": 0.722}, {"text": "billion", "start": 0.74, "end": 1.057}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 1.092, "end": 1.409}, {"text": "in", "start": 1.444, "end": 1.563}, {"text": "one", "start": 1.576, "end": 1.734}, {"text": "year", "start": 1.752, "end": 1.95}, {"text": "from", "start": 1.972, "end": 2.17}, {"text": "people", "start": 2.192, "end": 2.469}, {"text": "with", "start": 2.5, "end": 2.698}, {"text": "no", "start": 2.72, "end": 2.839}, {"text": "money.", "start": 2.852, "end": 3.129}]}, {"id": "k2", "text": "And the ones who paid it had the least.", "start": 3.8172083333333333, "end": 5.437208333333333, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 3.817, "end": 4.037}, {"text": "the", "start": 4.037, "end": 4.157}, {"text": "ones", "start": 4.157, "end": 4.317}, {"text": "who", "start": 4.317, "end": 4.457}, {"text": "paid", "start": 4.457, "end": 4.657}, {"text": "it", "start": 4.657, "end": 4.817}, {"text": "had", "start": 4.817, "end": 5.037}, {"text": "the", "start": 5.037, "end": 5.217}, {"text": "least.", "start": 5.217, "end": 5.437}]}, {"id": "k3", "text": "So why does being broke cost more than being rich?", "start": 6.458708333333333, "end": 9.258708333333333, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 6.459, "end": 6.679}, {"text": "why", "start": 6.939, "end": 7.159}, {"text": "does", "start": 7.159, "end": 7.299}, {"text": "being", "start": 7.299, "end": 7.499}, {"text": "broke", "start": 7.499, "end": 7.919}, {"text": "cost", "start": 7.919, "end": 8.319}, {"text": "more", "start": 8.319, "end": 8.579}, {"text": "than", "start": 8.579, "end": 8.759}, {"text": "being", "start": 8.759, "end": 8.959}, {"text": "rich?", "start": 8.959, "end": 9.259}]}, {"id": "k4", "text": "You will see who is cashing in and why toilet paper proves it.", "start": 9.98475, "end": 12.90475, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 9.985, "end": 10.065}, {"text": "will", "start": 10.065, "end": 10.145}, {"text": "see", "start": 10.145, "end": 10.325}, {"text": "who", "start": 10.325, "end": 10.505}, {"text": "is", "start": 10.505, "end": 10.605}, {"text": "cashing", "start": 10.605, "end": 10.945}, {"text": "in", "start": 10.945, "end": 11.185}, {"text": "and", "start": 11.185, "end": 11.485}, {"text": "why", "start": 11.485, "end": 11.665}, {"text": "toilet", "start": 11.665, "end": 11.965}, {"text": "paper", "start": 11.965, "end": 12.265}, {"text": "proves", "start": 12.265, "end": 12.625}, {"text": "it.", "start": 12.625, "end": 12.905}]}, {"id": "c1_01", "text": "Meet my bank account which right now holds four dollars and it is the most loyal thing in my life.", "start": 15.291020833333334, "end": 19.843020833333334, "words": [{"text": "Meet", "start": 15.291, "end": 15.499}, {"text": "my", "start": 15.522, "end": 15.647}, {"text": "bank", "start": 15.661000000000001, "end": 15.869000000000002}, {"text": "account", "start": 15.892000000000001, "end": 16.226}, {"text": "which", "start": 16.262999999999998, "end": 16.512}, {"text": "right", "start": 16.54, "end": 16.79}, {"text": "now", "start": 16.818, "end": 16.983999999999998}, {"text": "holds", "start": 17.003, "end": 17.253}, {"text": "four", "start": 17.28, "end": 17.488}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 17.512, "end": 17.845000000000002}, {"text": "and", "start": 17.882, "end": 18.048000000000002}, {"text": "it", "start": 18.067, "end": 18.192}, {"text": "is", "start": 18.206, "end": 18.330000000000002}, {"text": "the", "start": 18.344, "end": 18.511}, {"text": "most", "start": 18.529, "end": 18.738}, {"text": "loyal", "start": 18.761, "end": 19.011}, {"text": "thing", "start": 19.038, "end": 19.288}, {"text": "in", "start": 19.316, "end": 19.441}, {"text": "my",